'''Bloom''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] Knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Bloom Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Bloom Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Easter Event 2025|2025 Easter Event]]. 

== Appearance ==
It is a white to pink gradient blade with light, green detailed vines with pink flowers on both sides of the blade and the handle.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Flora]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bloom Set|Bloom Set]].

